<title>ARGENTINA: Central Costanera says takes $70 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Central Costanera says takes $70 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine electricity generator Central Costanera SA said Thursday it had taken out a $70 million loan from Bank of America.</p>
<p>In a brief note to the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange, Costanera added only that the loan was to refinance debts.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
